 forecast expects Scott to win, but by a narrower margin than his historical norm, with meaningful uncertainty given the thin and inconsistent polling.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.2101, "margin": -4.77}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0165, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0219, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0312, "margin": -10.8}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.2344, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2363, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2599, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2631, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2569, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.1727, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.1689, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1678, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1704, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.2792, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2255, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.1487, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2939, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.2369, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.2377, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.2359, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.1602, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.1605, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.1592, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.1895, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.1865, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.188, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.2026, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-19", "p_dem": 0.2056, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-20", "p_dem": 0.2051, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-21", "p_dem": 0.2447, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-22", "p_dem": 0.2077, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-23", "p_dem": 0.1918, "margin": -5.5}, {"date"